elevant": "Supports the goal of making better use of loan officers without overloading them.", "time_bound": "Evaluated across all simulated cases in the run"}, "target_direction": "minimize", "suggested_formula": "COUNT(applications_processed) / COUNT(loan_officers) across completed cases", "supported_by_log": true, "evidence_basis": "event_log_only", "process_scope": "end_to_end", "context_segmentation": [], "measurable_as": "Resource Utilization", "measurable_as_raw": null}], "reasoning": "This KPI set directly addresses the simulation goal by measuring both the speed of the loan assessment process and the utilization of loan officers. The average cycle time KPI focuses on reducing the time taken for a final decision, while the workload utilization KPI ensures that loan officers are effectively engaged without being overloaded. The duration of the loan risk assessment KPI, segmented by time of day, identifies potential bottlenecks that could be addressed to further improve efficiency."}
